# www app (`@pakfactory/www`)

Follow [`apps/www/CLAUDE.md`](../../CLAUDE.md), [`AGENTS.md`](../../../../AGENTS.md), [`DESIGN.md`](../../../../DESIGN.md) (UI), [`memory.md`](../../memory.md) (ops only).

**Quick rules:**

- **Not e-commerce:** quote / RFQ / contact CTAs — no cart/checkout unless requested.
- **PR base:** `www-new-release`.
- **Auth / Sanity / SEO:** Supabase + `@pakfactory/sanity/queries` + `@pakfactory/seo` only — see CLAUDE.md.
- **UI:** DESIGN.md + do not edit `packages/ui` primitives for features.
- **ADR-005:** routing-only `app/`; no new `app/_components/` (case-studies deferred).
- **Staging:** non-production `noindex`; `staging.pakfactory.com` is Vercel-auth-gated.
- **Local:** port **3003** (`pnpm dev:www`).
